{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Prometheus data source scraping the NinerLog API",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "9.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "NinerLog dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "ninerlog"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "ninerlog",
    "api",
    "ratelimit"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Data source"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "",
  "title": "NinerLog API \u2014 Rate Limits",
  "uid": "ninerlog-ratelimits",
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Every limiter reports two counters: `rate_limit_requests_total` (everything it evaluated) and `rate_limit_hits_total` (what it rejected). **The ratio is the signal \u2014 the rejection rate on its own is not.** 2 rejections/s is a non-event against 200 req/s and an outage against 3 req/s.\n\n**Tuning a limit:** find the bucket in *Rejection Ratio by Limiter*. A healthy interactive limit sits near 0%; sustained rejection means the limit is under-provisioned for real usage, not that users are abusing it. Raise it, then watch this panel and the p95 latency + DB pool panels on the Operational dashboard to confirm the extra traffic is actually affordable.\n\n**Limiters:** `general` 120/min (coarse backstop, all authenticated routes) \u00b7 `search` `$SEARCH_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE` default 60/min (`GET /flights?q=`) \u00b7 `expensive` 15/min (PDF export, imports, custom-currency preview) \u00b7 `auth` 10/min \u00b7 `admin` 30/min \u00b7 `sign` 20/min \u00b7 `signature_email` 10/min.\n\n`path` is the Gin route template, so it matches the `path` label on `http_requests_total`. Because the query string is not part of it, **the `limiter` label is the only thing separating a rejected search from a rejected plain listing on `/api/v1/flights`.**"
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Search Rejection Ratio (15m)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Share of /flights?q= requests turned away by the search limiter. Anything sustained above a few percent means real users are being throttled mid-typing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[15m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "search rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Searches Rejected (1h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Absolute count of search requests refused in the last hour \u2014 the number of times a user typed and got nothing back.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Search Traffic",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Search requests reaching the limiter, allowed or not. The denominator behind the ratio tiles.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "searches/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Overall Rejection Ratio (15m)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Rejections across every limiter as a share of all limiter evaluations.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[15m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[15m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "All Rejections (1h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Total 429s issued by any limiter in the last hour.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 19,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rejection Ratio by Limiter",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "The panel to tune limits from. Each series is rejections as a share of that limiter's own traffic, so buckets with very different volumes are directly comparable. A bucket pinned above zero is under-provisioned for real usage.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (limiter) (rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum by (limiter) (rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{limiter}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rejections by Limiter (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Absolute rejection rate per bucket. Read alongside the ratio panel \u2014 a big number here is only alarming if the ratio is too.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (limiter) (rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{limiter}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Search: Allowed vs Rejected",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Headroom on GET /flights?q=. The gap between the two lines is how much room the current SEARCH_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE leaves.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "rejected"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[5m])) - sum(rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "allowed"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Search Latency & Volume (GET /api/v1/flights)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "What raising the search limit costs. If p95 on the flights route climbs as search volume rises, the limit is protecting something real; if it stays flat, there is more headroom.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "search req/s"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "reqps"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"ninerlog-api\", path=\"/api/v1/flights\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 latency"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"ninerlog-api\", path=\"/api/v1/flights\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 latency"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", limiter=\"search\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "search req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rejections by Route",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Which endpoints users are actually being turned away from. Route templates, so /flights/:id is one series rather than one per flight.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "topk(10, sum by (limiter, path) (rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{limiter}} \u00b7 {{path}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "429s Served (from http_requests_total)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Independent cross-check derived from the HTTP counter rather than the limiter counters. A persistent gap against 'Rejections by Limiter' means 429s are coming from somewhere other than these limiters.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 1
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (path) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\", status=\"429\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(rate_limit_hits_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "total (limiter counters)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Traffic Evaluated by Limiter (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "How much traffic each bucket sees. 'general' covers every authenticated route, so it is expected to dominate; the narrow buckets show how heavily their specific features are used.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (limiter) (rate(rate_limit_requests_total{job=\"ninerlog-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{limiter}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
